10 REM FRERE JACQUES: A ROUND FOR THREE SID VOICES
20 REM EACH VOICE IS ONE SOUND CHANNEL; THE SEQUENCER QUEUES THE LOT
30 DIM P%(31),D%(31)
40 FOR I%=0 TO 31:READ P%(I%),D%(I%):NEXT
50 SOUND 2,0,0,32:SOUND 3,0,0,64
60 FOR V%=1 TO 3
70 FOR I%=0 TO 31:SOUND V%,-12,P%(I%),D%(I%):NEXT
80 NEXT
90 PRINT "THREE VOICES, ONE TUNE. (LISTEN.)"
100 END
110 DATA 53,8,61,8,69,8,53,8,53,8,61,8,69,8,53,8
120 DATA 69,8,73,8,81,16,69,8,73,8,81,16
130 DATA 81,4,89,4,81,4,73,4,69,8,53,8,81,4,89,4,81,4,73,4,69,8,53,8
140 DATA 53,8,33,8,53,16,53,8,33,8,53,16
